; The main data file. Specify this with hledger's -f option or $LEDGER_FILE.
; Syntax: https://hledger.org/hledger.html#journal

; Declarations, helpful for reports and error checking,
; kept in their own files for easier maintenance.

include accounts.journal
include commodities.journal
include payees.journal


; Opening balances. 
; Pick a start date for this journal, some assets and liabilities to be tracked,
; and record their balances at the start of this day.

2021-01-01 opening balances
    assets:bank:checking                       $1000
    assets:cash                                 $100
    liabilities:bank:credit card                $-50.12
    equity:start

; Transactions. 
; Keeping them all here is simplest; or you can keep them in subfiles and include those.
; Keeping them in date order allows extra error checking (hledger check ordereddates).

2021-01-02 received wages
    revenues:salary
    assets:bank:checking                       $1000

2021-01-03 Whole Foods | bought groceries
    assets:cash
    expenses:food                                $50

